<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina says placed $5.62 bln in reverse repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina says placed $5.62 bln in reverse repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Wednesday it placed $5.62 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were placed at 4.75 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0652))</p>
</text>
